<section id="authentication" class="resource-group"><h2 class="group-heading">Authentication <a href="#authentication" class="permalink">&para;</a></h2><p>The authentication is based on JWT (JSON Web Token).</p>
<h3 id="header-token-(jwt)">Token (JWT) <a class="permalink" href="#header-token-(jwt)" aria-hidden="true">¶</a></h3>
<pre><code class="language-json">{
